<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<title>424 Baldwin Ave BOV</title>
<style>
  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  :root{--navy:#1B3A5C;--navy-dark:#122845;--lime:#A8C840;--lime-dark:#8AAF28;--white:#FFFFFF;--off-white:#F5F6F4;--light:#EAECEB;--mid:#8A9099;--text:#1C2B3A;--text-light:#4A5A6A;--border:#D4D8DC;}
  @media print{
    body{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;}
    .no-print{display:none !important;}
    .hl-card,.table,.overview-grid,.metrics,.quick-facts,.header,.ov-item,.macro-stats{break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid;}
  }
  body{background:var(--white);color:var(--text);font-family:'Barlow',sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;}
  .no-print{position:fixed;top:16px;right:20px;z-index:100;}
  .print-btn{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 22px;font-family:'Barlow',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px;}
  .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 0 80px;}

  /* HEADER */
  .header{background:var(--navy);padding:22px 48px 26px;position:relative;}
  .header::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px;background:var(--lime);}
  .header-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:28px;}
  .header-logo-mark{position:relative;width:34px;height:34px;flex:none;}
  .header-logo-mark .sq1{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:24px;height:24px;background:var(--lime);border-radius:2px;}
  .header-logo-mark .sq2{position:absolute;top:1px;right:0;width:14px;height:14px;background:var(--navy-dark);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);border-radius:1px;}
  .header-logo-mark .sq3{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:5px;width:12px;height:12px;background:var(--lime-dark);border-radius:1px;}
  .header-logo-text{line-height:1.2;}
  .header-logo-name{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;}
  .header-logo-tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);margin-top:1px;}
  .header-eyebrow{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime);margin-bottom:18px;}
  .header-address{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.0;color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .header-sub{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime);}
  .header-summary{font-size:15.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);line-height:1.75;font-weight:400;margin-top:22px;max-width:820px;}
  .header-summary p + p{margin-top:12px;}
  .header-summary strong{color:#fff;font-weight:700;}
  .header-bottom-rule{width:46px;height:3px;background:var(--lime);margin-top:26px;}

  /* METRICS */
  .metrics{background:var(--navy-dark);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:3px solid var(--lime);}
  .metric{padding:16px 12px;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);}
  .metric:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .metric-num{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--lime);display:block;line-height:1;margin-bottom:3px;}
  .metric-num.white{color:#fff;}
  .metric-label{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);line-height:1.3;}
  .metric.recommended{background:var(--lime);border-right-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.08);}
  .metric.recommended .metric-badge{font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy-dark);margin-bottom:3px;}
  .metric.recommended .metric-num{color:var(--navy-dark);}
  .metric.recommended .metric-label{color:var(--navy-dark);opacity:0.65;}

  /* PHOTO */
  .photo-wrap{width:100%;height:420px;overflow:hidden;}
  .photo-wrap img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%;}

  /* QUICK FACTS — below photo */
  .quick-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);background:var(--navy);}
  .qf-item{padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}
  .qf-item:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .qf-val{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;display:block;line-height:1;margin-bottom:3px;}
  .qf-label{font-size:8.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);}

  .section{padding:32px 48px 0;}
  .rule{height:3px;background:var(--navy);margin:32px 0 0;position:relative;}
  .rule::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:50px;height:3px;background:var(--lime);}
  .eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime-dark);margin-bottom:4px;margin-top:8px;}
  .h2{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:0.02em;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .body{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.8;}
  .body strong{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;}
  .body p + p{margin-top:10px;}

  /* OVERVIEW GRID */
  .overview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;margin-top:18px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;}
  .ov-item{display:flex;align-items:stretch;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  .ov-item:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:none;}
  .ov-key{background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:10px 14px;min-width:130px;display:flex;align-items:center;}
  .ov-val{background:var(--white);font-size:13px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;padding:10px 14px;flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;border-left:1px solid var(--border);}
  .ov-item:nth-child(odd){border-right:1px solid var(--border);}

  /* TABLES */
  .table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:16px;font-size:12.5px;}
  .table th{background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:10px 12px;text-align:left;}
  .table th.num{text-align:right;}
  .table td{padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--light);color:var(--text-light);}
  .table td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .table td.label{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;}
  .table td.green{color:#2E7D32;font-weight:600;}
  .table td.red{color:#C0392B;}
  .table tr.total td{background:var(--off-white);font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);border-top:2px solid var(--navy);}
  .table tr.noi td{background:rgba(138,175,40,0.1);font-weight:700;color:var(--lime-dark);border-top:2px solid var(--lime);}
  .table tr.comp-row td{background:#F0F2F4;font-style:italic;}
  .table-scroll{overflow-x:auto;}
  .table th.hl-col{background:var(--navy-dark);color:#fff;}
  .table td.hl-col{background:rgba(168,200,64,0.16);color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;}
  .table tr.total td.hl-col{background:rgba(168,200,64,0.28);}
  .table th.total-col{background:var(--navy-dark);color:#fff;border-left:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);}
  .table td.total-col{background:var(--off-white);color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;border-left:2px solid var(--border);}

  /* HIGHLIGHTS */
  .highlights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:16px;}
  .hl-card{background:var(--off-white);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--navy);padding:15px 17px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;}
  .hl-head{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:4px;}
  .hl-body{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.6;}

  /* MACRO STATS ROW */
  .macro-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:16px;}
  .macro-stat{background:var(--navy);border-radius:4px;padding:14px 16px;border-top:3px solid var(--lime);}
  .macro-stat-val{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1;margin-bottom:4px;}
  .macro-stat-label{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime);}
  .macro-stat-sub{font-size:9.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);margin-top:4px;}

  .footnote{font-size:11px;color:var(--mid);font-style:italic;margin-top:10px;}
  .disclaimer{font-size:10px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.5;margin-top:28px;padding:0 48px;font-style:italic;}

  /* DARK SECTION — blends into the footer */
  .section-dark{background:var(--navy);margin-top:32px;padding:32px 48px 34px;}
  .section-dark .rule{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);}
  .section-dark .rule::after{background:var(--lime);}
  .section-dark .eyebrow{color:var(--lime);}
  .section-dark .h2{color:#fff;}
  .section-dark .body{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);}
  .section-dark .body strong{color:#fff;}
  .section-dark .footnote{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);}
  .section-dark .macro-stat{background:#fff;border-top:3px solid var(--lime);}
  .section-dark .macro-stat-val{color:var(--navy);}
  .section-dark .macro-stat-label{color:var(--lime-dark);}
  .section-dark .macro-stat-sub{color:var(--text-light);}

  .footer{background:var(--navy);padding:26px 48px 22px;margin-top:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;}
  .footer-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}
  .footer-left{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;}
  .footer-left span{color:var(--lime);}
  .footer-contacts{display:flex;gap:40px;}
  .footer-contact{font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);line-height:1.6;}
  .footer-contact strong{color:#fff;font-size:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;}
  .footer-tag{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime);margin-top:8px;}
  .footer-disclaimer{font-size:9.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);line-height:1.5;font-style:italic;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);padding-top:16px;}

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .header{padding:18px 20px;}
    .header-address{font-size:30px;}
    .header-sub{font-size:16px;}
    .header-summary{font-size:14px;}
    .metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .metric{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);}
    .quick-facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .qf-item{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}
    .section{padding:26px 20px 0;}
    .overview-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .ov-item:nth-child(odd){border-right:none;}
    .ov-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
    .highlights{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .macro-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .footer{padding:22px 20px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}
    .disclaimer{padding:0 20px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="no-print">
  <button class="print-btn" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-logo">
      <div class="header-logo-mark">
        <span class="sq1"></span><span class="sq2"></span><span class="sq3"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="header-logo-text">
        <div class="header-logo-name">Grid</div>
        <div class="header-logo-tag">Real Estate &middot; Brokers &amp; Advisors</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-eyebrow">Broker Opinion of Value &middot; Off-Market Offering</div>
    <div class="header-address">424 Baldwin Ave</div>
    <div class="header-sub">Jersey City, NJ &middot; The Heights</div>
    <div class="header-summary">
      <p>424 Baldwin Ave is a <strong>&plusmn;4,725 GSF</strong> corner mixed-use building on a <strong>28' x 50' (1,400 SF)</strong> lot, zoned RC-3. The four-story building is configured with three 2-bedroom/1-bath apartments over a garden-level retail/office suite, and can be <strong>delivered vacant or with the three residential tenants in place</strong> &mdash; the ground-floor retail suite is vacant either way.</p>
      <p><strong>Two of the three residential units are occupied with strong rents</strong>; the top-floor unit is underwritten roughly <strong>$750/month below</strong> its in-building comps &mdash; <strong>an immediate path to upside once renovated</strong>. The property carries <strong>no rent control</strong>, preserving full pricing flexibility going forward, and the vacant ground floor is turnkey for an owner-occupier looking to run a business downstairs while the residential units carry the mortgage upstairs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="header-bottom-rule"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="metrics">
    <div class="metric">
      <span class="metric-num white">$1.075M&ndash;$1.2M</span>
      <span class="metric-label">Pricing Guidance</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <span class="metric-num">$1.2M</span>
      <span class="metric-label">Opportunistic</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric recommended">
      <div class="metric-badge">Grid Recommended</div>
      <span class="metric-num">$1.14M</span>
      <span class="metric-label">Base</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <span class="metric-num">$1.075M</span>
      <span class="metric-label">Conservative</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="photo-wrap">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="424 Baldwin Ave, Jersey City">
  </div>

  <div class="quick-facts">
    <div class="qf-item"><span class="qf-val">RC-3</span><span class="qf-label">Zoning</span></div>
    <div class="qf-item"><span class="qf-val">1,400 SF</span><span class="qf-label">Lot Size (28' x 50')</span></div>
    <div class="qf-item"><span class="qf-val">78'</span><span class="qf-label">Combined Frontage</span></div>
    <div class="qf-item"><span class="qf-val">&plusmn;4,725 SF</span><span class="qf-label">Total Building Area</span></div>
    <div class="qf-item"><span class="qf-val">4</span><span class="qf-label">Stories</span></div>
    <div class="qf-item"><span class="qf-val">4</span><span class="qf-label">Units</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Value Drivers</div>
    <div class="h2">Site Highlights</div>
    <div class="highlights">
      <div class="hl-card">
        <div class="hl-head">No Rent Control</div>
        <div class="hl-body">Unlike much of Jersey City's older housing stock, 424 Baldwin carries no rent-control restriction &mdash; ownership keeps full flexibility to mark rents to market at every turnover.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hl-card">
        <div class="hl-head">Renovation Upside</div>
        <div class="hl-body">The top-floor 2BR is underwritten at $1,900/month against the $2,650 market rent set by the other two units in the building &mdash; roughly $750/month, or about $9,000/year, of upside once the unit is renovated and repositioned to market.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hl-card">
        <div class="hl-head">Flexible Delivery</div>
        <div class="hl-body">Grid can deliver 424 Baldwin fully vacant or with the three residential tenants in place &mdash; a buyer's choice between immediate owner-user/renovation flexibility or in-place cash flow from day one. The ground-floor retail suite is vacant either way.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hl-card">
        <div class="hl-head">Owner-User Ground Floor</div>
        <div class="hl-body">The garden-level retail/office suite is ideal for an owner-occupier &mdash; run a business downstairs while three residential units generate offsetting cash flow upstairs.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Cash Flow</div>
    <div class="h2">Income &amp; Operating Expenses</div>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Unit</th><th>Type</th><th class="num">In-Place Monthly</th><th class="num hl-col">Pro Forma Monthly</th><th class="num">In-Place Annual</th><th class="num hl-col">Pro Forma Annual</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="label">Unit 1 (Garden Level)</td><td>Retail / Office &mdash; Vacant</td><td class="num">$1,850</td><td class="num hl-col">$1,850</td><td class="num">$22,200</td><td class="num hl-col">$22,200</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Unit 2</td><td>2BR / 1BA</td><td class="num">$2,650</td><td class="num hl-col">$2,650</td><td class="num">$31,800</td><td class="num hl-col">$31,800</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Unit 3</td><td>2BR / 1BA</td><td class="num">$2,650</td><td class="num hl-col">$2,650</td><td class="num">$31,800</td><td class="num hl-col">$31,800</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Unit 4 (Top Floor)</td><td>2BR / 1BA &mdash; renovation candidate</td><td class="num">$1,900</td><td class="num hl-col">$2,650</td><td class="num">$22,800</td><td class="num hl-col">$31,800</td></tr>
          <tr class="total"><td class="label">Gross Potential Rent</td><td></td><td class="num">$9,050</td><td class="num hl-col">$9,800</td><td class="num">$108,600</td><td class="num hl-col">$117,600</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Less: Vacancy / Credit Loss (3%)</td><td></td><td class="num"></td><td class="num hl-col"></td><td class="num red">&minus;$3,258</td><td class="num hl-col red">&minus;$3,528</td></tr>
          <tr class="total"><td class="label">Effective Gross Income</td><td></td><td class="num"></td><td class="num hl-col"></td><td class="num">$105,342</td><td class="num hl-col">$114,072</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <table class="table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Operating Expense</th><th class="num">In-Place Annual</th><th class="num hl-col">Pro Forma Annual</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="label">Real Estate Taxes</td><td class="num">$19,545</td><td class="num hl-col">$19,545</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Insurance</td><td class="num">$8,200</td><td class="num hl-col">$8,200</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Water / Sewer</td><td class="num">$3,850</td><td class="num hl-col">$3,850</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Repairs</td><td class="num">$3,200</td><td class="num hl-col">$3,200</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Management</td><td class="num">$3,200</td><td class="num hl-col">$3,200</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Electric (Common Area)</td><td class="num">$250</td><td class="num hl-col">$250</td></tr>
          <tr class="total"><td class="label">Total Operating Expenses</td><td class="num">$38,245</td><td class="num hl-col">$38,245</td></tr>
          <tr class="noi"><td class="label">Net Operating Income (NOI)</td><td class="num">$67,097</td><td class="num hl-col">$75,827</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="footnote">All units are separately metered for utilities; the $250 electric line reflects common-area service only. Real estate taxes, insurance, and water/sewer are shown as billed; repairs and management are Grid-standard underwriting allowances. Pro forma assumes Unit 4 renovated and re-leased at the $2,650 rent set by Units 2 and 3; operating expenses are held flat.</div>
    <div class="hl-card" style="margin-top:16px;border-left-color:var(--lime-dark);">
      <div class="hl-head">The Alpha: In-Place vs. Pro Forma Cap Rate</div>
      <div class="hl-body">At Grid's Base price of $1,140,000, in-place NOI underwrites to a <strong>5.89%</strong> cap rate. The same price against pro forma NOI &mdash; Unit 4 renovated and re-leased to the $2,650 in-building market rent &mdash; underwrites to a <strong>6.65%</strong> cap rate. That ~76-basis-point gap is the alpha: a buyer at today's in-place pricing is effectively buying a forward 6.65% cap rate once the renovation is complete.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Valuation</div>
    <div class="h2">Pricing Scenarios</div>
    <div class="body"><p>Scenario pricing is spread across Grid's $1.075M&ndash;$1.2M guidance range on the $67,097 underwritten NOI, implying a going-in cap rate of roughly 5.6%&ndash;6.2%.</p></div>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Metric</th><th class="num">Opportunistic</th><th class="num hl-col">Base</th><th class="num">Conservative</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="label">Value</td><td class="num">$1,200,000</td><td class="num hl-col">$1,140,000</td><td class="num">$1,075,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">Going-In Cap Rate</td><td class="num">5.59%</td><td class="num hl-col">5.89%</td><td class="num">6.24%</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="label">$ / Building SF</td><td class="num">$253.97</td><td class="num hl-col">$241.27</td><td class="num">$227.51</td></tr>
